---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const breadcrumbs = [{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }];
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Market Matters Online"
  description="Privacy Policy for Market Matters Online. How we collect, use, and protect your data."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <div class="site-container-narrow section-pad">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 mb-10">Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Market Matters Online ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and what rights you have over your data.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>Newsletter subscriptions</h3>
      <p>
        When you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address. We use this to send you the Market Matters Brief and occasional product or affiliate recommendations. We use a third-party email service provider (such as ConvertKit or Beehiiv) to manage our list.
      </p>
      <h3>Usage data</h3>
      <p>
        We may use analytics tools (such as Google Analytics or Plausible Analytics) to understand how visitors use our site. This may include pages visited, time on site, device type, and general geographic location. We do not collect personally identifiable information through analytics.
      </p>
      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        Our site may use cookies from analytics tools and affiliate tracking systems. You can control cookie settings through your browser.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To send the newsletter you subscribed to</li>
        <li>To improve our site content based on usage data</li>
        <li>To track affiliate referrals (for compensation purposes)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>We Do Not Sell Your Data</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses third-party services that may collect data under their own privacy policies, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email service providers (ConvertKit, Beehiiv, or similar)</li>
        <li>Analytics providers</li>
        <li>Affiliate networks</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may at any time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Unsubscribe from our newsletter (link in every email)</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your email address from our list</li>
        <li>Request information about data we hold about you</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at: <strong>hello@marketmattersonline.com</strong></p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected by the "Last updated" date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Email us: <strong>hello@marketmattersonline.com</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
